cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use Folio Lab for results you publish, please cite it as below, and state the Folio Lab version and the
  version of each analysis module you used (shown in the module header and stored in every report bundle).
type: software
title: "Folio Lab: local data analysis and report writing for laboratory measurements"
abstract: >-
  Folio Lab is a local, browser-based suite that joins a LaTeX report editor with analysis modules for tensile
  tests, microscopy images, FTIR spectra, thermogravimetry, data cleaning, scientific calculation with units, and
  chemistry. Results go into reports with their figures, tables, values and citations, and every value can be traced
  back to its raw file.
authors:
  - name: FolioLab-OP
version: 0.4.0
date-released: "2026-11-19"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/FolioLab-OP/FolioLab"
url: "https://github.com/FolioLab-OP/FolioLab"
keywords:
  - laboratory data analysis
  - reproducibility
  - LaTeX
  - tensile testing
  - microscopy
  - FTIR spectroscopy
  - thermogravimetric analysis
  - scientific calculator
